    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "75501893be5c68531a469ceacf718aab28a2211c427a04d3cd736c3f7ae161ee",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. A private half-day tour of the Brazilian side of Iguazu with an English-speaking guide. Panoramic walkways overlook the Floriano, Deodoro, Benjamin Constant and Garganta del Diablo falls. Entrance tickets for the main programme are included.\n\nOptional additions include the Bird Park at $100 per person, Macuco Safari at $150 per person, and a helicopter tour above the falls. The helicopter flight price is quoted separately. At the Bird Park, you can see parrots, toucans, hummingbirds, herons and local insects. The helicopter departs from the Brazilian side, offering panoramic views of the entire system of cascades. Overnight at a hotel in the Iguazu region.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261103-bf0c143a",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Verified Word paragraphs 116, 118 and 226–229 do not contain the current RU half-day, optional $100/$150 tariffs, helicopter terms and full service details; translate canonical RU and apply approved English guide-language adaptation."
